Every buprenorphine-treatment is an opioid-use-disorder-medication-treatment.
Every methadone-treatment is an opioid-use-disorder-medication-treatment.
If a patient takes a benzodiazepine then every clinician should not withhold an opioid-use-disorder-medication-treatment from the patient.
If a patient takes a central-nervous-system-depressant then every clinician should not withhold an opioid-use-disorder-medication-treatment from the patient.
